21:49.270 --> 21:50.830
Sudah, cepat naik dan duduk di sana.

21:50.830 --> 21:51.830
Jangan sampai kehilangan fokus, ya.

21:51.830 --> 21:53.070
Ibu yakin kamu bisa.

21:53.440 --> 21:54.240
Semangat.

21:54.640 --> 21:55.240
Semangat.

21:57.720 --> 21:59.440
